h/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;is an&nbsp;identity matrix)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>2023</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mn>2023</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2023</mn><mi>i</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Inverse of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>AM</mi><mn>2023</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2023</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p>"
